  "description": "FOXNIR crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C21 H46 Fe2 Gd3 N9 O26,0.5(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Fe1 (Fe) has 5 O neighbors; Fe2 (Fe) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.201-5.068 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 86.04-173.60°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links.",
